      "product_faq": [
        {
          "question": "What are the available colors and sizes?",
          "answer": "Black, Yellow, Khaki; EU 39-48. List the pair quantity for each color and EU size to request your assortment."
        },
        {
          "question": "Does this boot have both laces and a zipper?",
          "answer": "Yes. It has conventional laces with upper hook eyelets, plus a side zipper. A contrast ankle strap and pull tab complete the ankle-height design."
        },
        {
          "question": "How does this version differ in its ankle details?",
          "answer": "It combines plush lining with a contrast ankle strap, upper hook eyelets and a pull tab. These details create a more layered winter boot appearance."
        },
        {
          "question": "How should I choose a size?",
          "answer": "Request an EU sample size using your foot length and the socks you intend to wear. During the fitting, assess toe space, heel fit and the upper closure before choosing the bulk size assortment."
        },
        {
          "question": "What is the minimum order for the original style?",
          "answer": "The original-style wholesale minimum is 2 pairs. Quantity pricing is shown on this page. Logo, material or custom packaging requests are quoted separately from the original-style order."
        },
        {
          "question": "How can I arrange a sample?",
          "answer": "Request a sample quotation with your preferred color, EU size and delivery postcode. The quotation will include the sample charge, shipping cost and proposed dispatch schedule."
        },
        {
          "question": "What should I send for a branding or packaging quotation?",
          "answer": "Send your logo artwork, preferred placement, packaging brief and order quantity. We can review the brief for this style and provide a proposal with the applicable minimum, cost and sample process."
        },
        {
          "question": "How can I get a delivered quotation and shipment schedule?",
          "answer": "Send the color-size quantities and destination postcode or port, plus any packaging request. The quotation separates product cost from freight and sets out the dispatch plan and estimated transit time for your chosen shipping method."
        }
      ],
