      "product_summary": "Plush-lined winter ankle boots with laces, upper hook eyelets and a side zipper. The zipper provides an additional opening for putting the boot on, while the laces adjust the upper. A contrast ankle strap and pull tab give the style a distinctive seasonal boot profile.\nBlack, Yellow, Khaki; EU 39-48 provide color and size choices for wholesale assortments.",
      "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China and serves overseas B2B footwear buyers. Share footwear specifications, quantities, packaging needs and destination for review and quotation. Company images introduce company activities and order coordination."
